`VaultLib.__addLiquidityToAmmUnchecked()`:
https://github.com/sherlock-audit/2024-08-cork-protocol/blob/db23bf67e45781b00ee6de5f6f23e621af16bd7e/Depeg-swap/contracts/libraries/VaultLib.sol#L55
## Tool used

